## 2.2 Ganti polling response dengan event-driven DOM observation

Saat ini `_wait_for_response_inner` memakai:

```python
time.sleep(1.0)
```

Ini cukup stabil, tetapi kurang optimal.

Plan:

- gunakan `MutationObserver`.
- deteksi perubahan assistant message.
- pakai stability check.
- fallback polling ringan jika observer tidak menangkap event.

Konsep:

```javascript
() => {
  return new Promise((resolve) => {
    let last = "";
    let stable = 0;
    const deadline = Date.now() + timeoutMs;

    const check = () => {
      const current = window.__getLatestAssistantText?.() || "";

      if (current && current === last) {
        stable += 1;
        if (stable >= 3) {
          cleanup();
          resolve(current);
          return;
        }
      } else {
        stable = 0;
        last = current;
      }

      if (Date.now() > deadline) {
        cleanup();
        resolve(last);
        return;
      }
    };

    const observer = new MutationObserver(check);
    observer.observe(document.body, {
      childList: true,
      subtree: true,
      characterData: true
    });

    const interval = setInterval(check, 300);

    function cleanup() {
      observer.disconnect();
      clearInterval(interval);
    }
  });
}
```

Acceptance:

- response selesai terdeteksi lebih cepat.
- tidak bergantung penuh pada `sleep(1.0)`.
- streaming tetap terdeteksi.
- stability check tetap ada untuk menghindari output premature.

