# 6. CI Linux-Only

CI tetap penting, tetapi tidak perlu matrix cross-platform.

Gunakan satu runner Linux saja.

Contoh GitHub Actions:

```yaml
name: Linux CI

on:
  push:
  pull_request:

jobs:
  linux-native:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest

    steps:
      - name: Checkout
        uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - name: Setup Python
        uses: actions/setup-python@v5
        with:
          python-version: "3.12"

      - name: Install system dependencies
        run: |
          sudo apt-get update
          sudo apt-get install -y \
            libnss3 \
            libnspr4 \
            libdbus-1-3 \
            libatk1.0-0 \
            libatk-bridge2.0-0 \
            libcups2 \
            libxcomposite1 \
            libxdamage1 \
            libxfixes3 \
            libxrandr2 \
            libgbm1 \
            libasound2

      - name: Install Python dependencies
        run: |
          python -m pip install --upgrade pip
          pip install -r requirements.txt
          pip install mypy pytest

      - name: Install Playwright browser
        run: |
          python -m playwright install chromium
          python -m playwright install-deps chromium

      - name: Type check
        run: |
          mypy src --strict

      - name: Unit + fixture tests
        run: |
          pytest tests/ -m "not e2e" -v
```

Acceptance:

- CI hanya Linux.
- tidak ada test Windows/macOS.
- type check wajib pass.
- test non-E2E wajib pass.
- E2E live Qwen tidak wajib di CI normal karena butuh session.

